        <activityName xml:lang="en">District heat, at consumer, diesel cogen 1MWth, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, diesel cogen 1MWth, allocation exergy
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat from light fuel oil in cogeneration plant only. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation. For heat from cogeneration economic allocation was used.;
UUID: 9f2d6e0b-5897-3f3c-b6f7-6f883017136f
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from light fuel oil at cogen 1MWth.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9f2d6e0b-5897-3f3c-b6f7-6f883017136f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
